 <span begin="18.401" end="18.630">I</span> <span begin="18.630" end="19.047">always</span> <span begin="19.047" end="19.484">feel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我一直以来的感受</span></p><p begin="19.715" end="21.319" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.715" end="19.931">Some</span><span begin="19.931" end="20.131">thing</span> <span begin="20.131" end="20.386">is</span> <span begin="20.386" end="20.595">not</span> <span begin="20.595" end="21.319">enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法让自己感到满足</span></p><p begin="21.476" end="23.091" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.476" end="21.708">That&apos;s</span> <span begin="21.708" end="21.934">how</span> <span begin="21.934" end="22.174">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="22.174" end="22.588">gonna</span> <span begin="22.588" end="23.091">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是最后的结局</span></p><p begin="23.280" end="24.905" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.280" end="23.494">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="23.494" end="23.732">all</span> <span begin="23.732" end="23.932">a</span> <span begin="23.932" end="24.160">part</span> <span begin="24.160" end="24.374">of</span> <span begin="24.374" end="24.905">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这都是生活的一部分</span></p><p begin="25.044" end="26.037" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.044" end="25.267">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="25.267" end="25.493">let</span> <span begin="25.493" end="25.704">this</span> <span begin="25.704" end="26.037">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会顺其自然</span></p><p begin="26.003" end="28.691" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="26.003" end="26.356">See</span> <span begin="26.356" end="26.834">what</span> <span begin="26.834" end="27.045">see</span> <span begin="27.045" end="27.500">what</span> <span begin="27.500" end="27.949">covered</span> <span begin="27.949" end="28.151">deep</span> <span begin="28.151" end="28.691">inside</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看清掩盖内心的托词</span></p><p begin="28.860" end="33.099" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="28.860" end="29.059">Let</span> <span begin="29.059" end="29.267">us</span> <span begin="29.267" end="29.473">hear</span> <span begin="29.473" end="29.719">the</span> <span begin="29.719" end="30.109">voice</span> <span begin="30.109" end="30.394">in</span> <span begin="30.394" end="30.834">you</span> <span begin="30.834" end="31.051">and</span> <span begin="31.051" end="31.267">re</span><span begin="31.267" end="31.495">so</span><span begin="31.495" end="31.837">nate</span> <span begin="31.837" end="32.169">in</span> <span begin="32.169" end="32.612">you</span> <span begin="32.612" end="32.817">hold</span> <span begin="32.817" end="33.099">on</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们听到你内心的声音 与你产生共鸣 请坚持下去</span></p><p begin="33.339" end="35.756" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="33.339" end="33.508">Pre</span><span begin="33.508" end="33.948">tend</span><span begin="33.948" end="34.146">ing</span> <span begin="34.146" end="34.609">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="34.609" end="34.817">bring</span> <span begin="34.817" end="35.055">it</span> <span begin="35.055" end="35.260">out</span> <span begin="35.260" end="35.489">of</span> <span begin="35.489" end="35.756">sight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假装你不会对此熟视无睹</span></p><p begin="36.003" end="38.484" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="36.003" end="36.199">It</span> <span begin="36.199" end="36.381">is</span> <span begin="36.381" end="36.836">always</span> <span begin="36.836" end="37.171">wait</span><span begin="37.171" end="37.484">ing</span> <span begin="37.484" end="37.941">there</span> <span begin="37.941" end="38.132">for</span> <span begin="38.132" end="38.484">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切总是在那里等待着你</span></p><p begin="40.400" en