tion" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都会好起来的 让我们出发吧</span></p><p begin="2:58.406" end="3:00.773" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.406" end="2:58.637">All</span> <span begin="2:58.637" end="2:58.843">I</span> <span begin="2:58.843" end="2:59.063">can</span> <span begin="2:59.063" end="2:59.277">do</span> <span begin="2:59.277" end="2:59.500">now</span> <span begin="2:59.500" end="2:59.732">is</span> <span begin="2:59.732" end="2:59.925">to</span> <span begin="2:59.925" end="3:00.148">have</span> <span begin="3:00.148" end="3:00.380">the</span> <span begin="3:00.380" end="3:00.773">fun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我所能做的就是享受欢乐</span></p><p begin="3:04.393" end="3:07.119" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.393" end="3:04.813">Every</span><span begin="3:04.813" end="3:05.051">thing</span> <span begin="3:05.051" end="3:05.500">is</span> <span begin="3:05.500" end="3:05.702">on</span> <span begin="3:05.702" end="3:05.931">the</span> <span begin="3:05.931" end="3:06.362">line</span> <span begin="3:06.362" end="3:06.591">as</span> <span begin="3:06.591" end="3:06.814">I</span> <span begin="3:06.814" end="3:07.119">draw</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都呈现在我描绘的线条上</span></p><p begin="3:07.265" end="3:10.659" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:07.265" end="3:07.693">Using</span> <span begin="3:07.693" end="3:08.169">my</span> <span begin="3:08.169" end="3:08.392">own</span> <span begin="3:08.392" end="3:09.034">unique</span> <span begin="3:09.034" end="3:09.492">usage</span> <span begin="3:09.492" end="3:09.926">of</span> <span begin="3:09.926" end="3:10.363">colors</span> <span begin="3:10.363" end="3:10.659">and</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">运用我独一无二的色彩搭配法则</span></p><p begin="3:10.865" end="3:14.242" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:10.865" end="3:11.278">Every</span> <span begin="3:11.278" end="3:11.721">dawn</span> <span begin="3:11.721" end="3:12.